  "description": "When riding on challenging terrain, you need to be able to rely on your companion. The Sonic AM 4 ABS not only offers you uncompromising equipment down to the last component, but also provides maximum safety on all paths and trails thanks to the additional Bosch ABS. This allows you to combine sporty safety with full E-MTB action.\n\nThe sophisticated Sonic carbon frame, RockShox suspension and other highlights such as the Magura Gustav Pro brake system ensure full performance in combination with the Bosch Performance Line CX drive. Another safety feature on board is the integrated lighting with MonkeyLink cornering lights and twin lights in the dropouts. Whether you're on long trail tours or staying out late in the beer garden afterwards, you'll always have the visibility and visibility you need.",
